00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.850
our system simpler.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:37.540
So here we go.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.030
So like who are we?

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:42.330
Our goal is to be your
one-stop shop for all

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.380
your spatial data needs.

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:49.050
So we have satellite data
from our set of satellites.

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:50.850
We have a very massive
set of satellites,

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:55.890
