00:38:55.760 --> 00:38:59.790
So what we showed you was the
developer experience for Cloud

00:38:59.790 --> 00:39:02.780
Run on GKE, and you saw when
Mark showed the Services

00:39:02.780 --> 00:39:06.520
tab in Cloud Run, it's actually
the same developer experience.

00:39:06.520 --> 00:39:08.630
There are just different
configuration options

00:39:08.630 --> 00:39:10.770
that are available
in each environment.

00:39:10.770 --> 00:39:12.170
And you can mix and match.

00:39:12.170 --> 00:39:14.510
You could decide, well,
I have a cluster already,

00:39:14.510 --> 00:39:16.070
I'm going to use
the spare capacity

00:39:16.070 --> 00:39:17.610
to do part of my workload.

00:39:17.610 --> 00:39:19.610
I'm going to put some of
it on hosted Cloud Run.

00:39:19.610 --> 00:39:21.693
You could change your mind
later and move it back,

00:39:21.693 --> 00:39:23.840
it's extremely easy.

00:39:23.840 --> 00:39:26.690
And because it's all
powered by Knative,

00:39:26.690 --> 00:39:29.785
you're not using
a particular API

00:39:29.785 --> 00:39:31.910
that may not be available
in some other environment

00:39:31.910 --> 00:39:33.000
that you're running.

00:39:33.000 --> 00:39:34.462
So your workload is portable.

00:39:34.462 --> 00:39:36.920
There's another thing that's
portable, though, that I think

00:39:36.920 --> 00:39:38.780
it's really important to know.

00:39:38.780 --> 00:39:42.530
It is your skills as a
developer or as the tech person.

00:39:42.530 --> 00:39:46.400
We have a limited amount of
time to learn some new framework

00:39:46.400 --> 00:39:49.970
and some new stack,
and it's hard to know

00:39:49.970 --> 00:39:51.470
what thing to learn
that's actually

00:39:51.470 --> 00:39:52.845
going to be durable,
that's going

00:39:52.845 --> 00:39:54.990
to be useful in
multiple environments.

00:39:54.990 --> 00:39:57.350
And this is one of the things
that Knative gives you.

00:39:57.350 --> 00:40:00.890
Because it's a standard,
consistent, developer-friendly

00:40:00.890 --> 00:40:03.620
API that is available
on multiple vendors,

00:40:03.620 --> 00:40:06.380
not just Google
Cloud, you can know

00:40:06.380 --> 00:40:09.740
that the things that you've
learned, you can use elsewhere.

00:40:09.740 --> 00:40:12.350
So multiple teams working
in the same company

00:40:12.350 --> 00:40:15.532
can have a consistent
developer experience.

